<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. van Beethoven returns three months after his first visit. He wears both aids about eleven hours a day by the data log and uses the music program at the piano; audiology adjusted the high frequencies at his fine-tuning visit. He uses the remote microphone when teaching and live speech-to-text on his phone in meetings. He decided to tell his two closest colleagues, who now face him when they speak and send written agendas. He went to one hearing loss peer group and took information about an introductory American Sign Language class and Deaf community events; he is curious and has not decided. The tinnitus is still constant but no longer what he thinks about first. He has had seven therapy sessions. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hearing aids</td><td>About 11 hours a day by data logging</td></tr><tr><td>Communication</td><td>Remote microphone, speech-to-text, written agendas; two colleagues told</td></tr><tr><td>Tinnitus</td><td>Constant, less intrusive</td></tr><tr><td>Therapy</td><td>Seven sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>PHQ-9 6; GAD-7 5</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

